u001b[22m **Why.** A script sees the world only through the events it is given and an option's inputs: enough\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 101 \u001b[22m for a handler that reacts, not for one that looks around. Reload and fuel reports are what a modder\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m2\u001b[12G\u001b[22mneeds to\u001b[21Gwrite script\u001b[35Gquickly.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mWorking…\u001b[12G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
