[0.052, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m3\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines,\u001b[21Gremoved\u001b[29G\u001b[1m1\u001b[31G\u001b[22mline\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 145 \u001b[22m   16.5), times a factor of 1 up to 1 g and\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Gacceleration\u001b[72Gin\u001b[75Gg\u001b[77Gto\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gpower\u001b[90G`curveExponent`\u001b[106G(2)\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 146 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14Gabove it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[14G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 148 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mEach total is rounded up to the gram. The pellets' curve makes a hard burn a decision, not a          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 148 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mOnly the metres the drive itself thrusts over burn: a drive with a clearance crosses it on its        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 149 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mthrusters at each end, and those metres burn nothing (`Space::DriveMetres`,                           \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m50\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mcruising\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](space.md#cruising)). Each total is rounded up to the gram. The pellets' curve makes a hard \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m   \u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mbu\u001b[15Gn a decision, not a\u001b[35G   \u001b[39G     \u001b[45G      \u001b[52G    \u001b[57G       \u001b[65G                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 151 \u001b[22m default: at 2 g the pellets cost four times as much for each km/s\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 152 \u001b[22m ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-108\u001b[39m](decision-ledger.md#d-108)).\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning cd\u001b[14G'../manifest.l