[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[9G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m1\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mrun. So a `Space::Cr\u001b[33GiseDriv\u001b[41G` gained a `clearance` that\u001b[69Gthe cruise itself crosses on thrusters\u001b[108Gat\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 102 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242meach end, out of physics and under the fast-forward ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mcruising\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](space.md#cruising)), and `ClearOf`    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 103 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mstill flies a ship out of the 2 km reach first. Only the drive's own metres burn fuel.                \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m4\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B 105 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m###\u001b[16GThe\u001b[20Gfirst\u001b[26Glarger\u001b[33Ghull\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 106 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mFive suites fail after commit 2. They're\u001b[44Gprobably\u001b[53Gpinned\u001b[60Gsave\u001b[65Gbytes\u001b[71Gmoved\u001b[77Gby\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gtwo\u001b[88Gnew\u001b[92Gsaved\u001b[98Gfields;\u001b[106Gchecking.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gpins\u001b[12Gmoved.\u001b[19GFollowing\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Ghash-pin\u001b[42Gmemory's\u001b[51Gprocedure:\u001b[62GI'll\u001b[67Gshow\u001b[72Git's\u001b[77Gbytes\u001b[83Galone\u001b[89Gby\u001b[92Gdropping\u001b[101Gthe\u001b[105Gtwo\u001b[109Gnew\u001b[113Gsaved\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gfields for\u001b[14Gone ru\u001b[21G and checking\u001b[35Gthe old pins still pass.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mWriting ~/projects/manifest.lane-b/source/game/space/src/Types.cpp\u001b[K\r\u0